<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύσ-μα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>filings, shavings,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				442
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				96
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>: in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύσματα ξύλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					<u>Poliorc.</u>
					145.13
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. ἐλέφαντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					14.62.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>lint,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄχνη ὀθονίου.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>c.</b> in pl., <i>shreds</i> of
			flesh, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				59
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.382
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				18(1).730
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.176
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl.,
				<i>particles, motes</i> in the sunbeam, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴν εἶναι τὰ ἐν τῷ ἀέρι ξ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					404a3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				913a9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>that which is scratched</i> on a thing : hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύσματα</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γράμματα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
